  "Benefit: Tor helps hide your real IP from other peers.\n\nTrade-offs: Connecting and syncing may be slower, and battery and data use may increase. Transaction records remain public. If Tor fails, direct connections stay disabled.": "Tor\n\nFaida: husaidia kuficha IP yako halisi kutoka kwa nodi nyingine.\n\nHasara: kuunganisha na kusawazisha kunaweza kuwa polepole na matumizi ya betri na data kuongezeka. Rekodi za miamala zinabaki wazi. Muunganisho ukishindwa, muunganisho wa moja kwa moja unabaki umezimwa.",
  "Benefit: I2P helps hide your real IP from other I2P peers.\n\nTrade-offs: I2P peers are required. Connecting and syncing may be slower, and battery and data use may increase. Transaction records remain public. If I2P fails, direct connections stay disabled.": "I2P\n\nFaida: husaidia kuficha IP yako halisi kutoka kwa nodi nyingine.\n\nHasara: kuunganisha na kusawazisha kunaweza kuwa polepole na matumizi ya betri na data kuongezeka. Rekodi za miamala zinabaki wazi. Muunganisho ukishindwa, muunganisho wa moja kwa moja unabaki umezimwa.\n\nNodi za I2P zinahitajika.",
